## 6. 📋 Verification & Assurance Matrix

| Feature | Automated Test Command | Verification Criteria |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Relationship Delete** | `npm run test` / E2E script | Record is removed from `relationships` table; tree canvas updates. |
| **Member Edit** | `PATCH /family/members/:id` | Changes persist in `persons` table; reflected immediately in RTK cache. |
| **Event RSVPs** | `POST /family/events/:id/rsvp` | Unique constraint enforced per user; attendee count increments. |
| **Invitation Email** | `POST /family/invitations` | Nodemailer outputs preview URL or delivers to Gmail inbox. |
| **Super Admin Live** | Browser Inspection at `/admin-dashboard/super` | All counts reflect actual PostgreSQL row counts without mock data. |

